{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
{{prefix|en|osteo|arthritis}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|osteoarthritides|+}}

# {{lb|en|pathology}} A form of [[arthritis]], affecting mainly older people, caused by chronic degeneration of the [[cartilage]] and [[synovial membrane]] of the joints, leading to pain and stiffness.

